    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαυλ-ίζομαι</span></b> , Dep. with aor.
		
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encamp on the
				field,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.134
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλίζομαι.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>encamp near,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pass the night,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of birds, <i>roost
			in,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγείρῳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.929
			</span></i>.</div>
